     &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;Photos and video of the slide can be found on ODOT&rsquo;s&lt;a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-2.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fwww.flickr.com%252Fphotos%252Foregondot%252Falbums%252F72177720330870276%252F%2F1%2F0101019b1400ee65-8a6b4484-e3d9-4be0-8ce6-ebc52d398415-000000%2FnJidNy_dc_V1LFrnxyVW7y7tGu4eRI5osn4zUy8gCoI%3D435&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cerin.c.zysett%40oem.oregon.gov%7C8e6215cdea714e89e24b08de3cf8983c%7Caa3f6932fa7c47b4a0cea598cad161cf%7C0%7C0%7C639015235574418560%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=v6k0YJhN1f%2FH7gAiYpYm5jb2gs%2F6%2FNIa5AuySvaZcLw%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0"&gt; Flickr Album&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
