&lt;h1&gt;Coverage,&amp;nbsp;savings,&amp;nbsp;peace of&amp;nbsp;mind: Oregon&amp;nbsp;encourages&amp;nbsp;health plan&amp;nbsp;enrollment for 2026&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, arial, Geneva, Helvetica, Century; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SALEM, Ore. - As people in Oregon prepare to welcome in the new year, now is the time to make sure you and your family have the health coverage you need. Health insurance provides access to essential services&mdash;such as preventive care, routine checkups, prescriptions and protection from unexpected medical costs&mdash;helping you begin 2026 with confidence and peace of mind.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&ldquo;Many people in Oregon still qualify for financial help that significantly lowers the cost of health insurance through OregonHealthCare.gov,&rdquo; said Chiqui Flowers, director of the Oregon Health Insurance Marketplace. &ldquo;With enhanced premium tax credits set to expire at the end of this month unless Congress takes action, we want people to make the most of the savings available this year and avoid surprises.&rdquo;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why open enrollment matters more than ever in 2026&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left:30px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Financial assistance is still available&mdash;and may change next year&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left:30px"&gt;During open enrollment period for 2025, the vast majority of people in Oregon who enrolled through OregonHealthCare.gov qualified for financial help. In 2025, 80 percent of Marketplace enrollees received financial assistance to lower their monthly premiums. Though the amount of financial help people may qualify for is decreasing, this financial help is still available to many.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left:30px"&gt;Enhanced premium tax credits&mdash;which have kept premiums lower for many families since 2021&mdash;are scheduled to end after 2025 unless extended by the U.S. Congress. The&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://ohim.checkbookhealth.org/?utm_medium=email&amp;amp;utm_source=govdelivery#/" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(6, 66, 118); text-decoration-line: none; text-size-adjust: 100%;" target="_blank"&gt;Window Shopping tool at OregonHealthCare.gov&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;can help households estimate how these changes will affect their 2026 premium.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left:30px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Plans still cover comprehensive benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left:30px"&gt;All plans sold through OregonHealthCare.gov cover essential health benefits such as:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Preventive services (annual checkups, screenings, vaccinations)&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Mental and behavioral health care&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Pregnancy, maternity and newborn care&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Gender-affirming care&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Prescription drugs&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Emergency and hospitalization services&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left:30px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Every person in Oregon has multiple trusted private plan options&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, arial, Geneva, Helvetica, Century; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left:30px"&gt;Consumers can compare plans side by side, matching coverage to their providers, prescriptions and costs using the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://ohim.checkbookhealth.org/?utm_medium=email&amp;amp;utm_source=govdelivery#/" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(6, 66, 118); text-decoration-line: none; text-size-adjust: 100%;" target="_blank"&gt;OregonHealthCare.gov Window Shopping tool&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left:30px"&gt;&ldquo;Marketplace plans aren&rsquo;t one-size-fits-all,&rdquo; Flowers said. &ldquo;People can choose from a range of private health insurance options across the state. It gives individuals control over their care and their budgets.&rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left:30px"&gt;This year, every individual in Oregon can choose from five health insurance companies offering at least 37 plan options statewide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left:30px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Beware of imposter sites&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left:30px"&gt;Financial help is&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;only&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;available through the official Marketplace website. Always start at&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;OregonHealthCare.gov&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and make sure any website you use ends in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&ldquo;.gov.&rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left:30px"&gt;&ldquo;We continue to see third-party websites misleading consumers into plans that don&rsquo;t offer full benefits or financial help,&rdquo; Flowers warned. &ldquo;Start at OregonHealthCare.gov to protect your personal information.&rdquo;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Help is available&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are offered insurance through an employer, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://or-affordabilityestimator.checkbookhealth.org/?utm_medium=email&amp;amp;utm_source=govdelivery#/" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(6, 66, 118); text-decoration-line: none; text-size-adjust: 100%;" target="_blank"&gt;orhim.info/ESIcoverage&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to check whether it is considered affordable. If not, you may qualify for Marketplace savings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OregonHealthCare.gov partners with health coverage experts who provide free, local help in multiple languages. Insurance agents can even recommend a plan. Visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://healthcare.oregon.gov/Pages/find-help.aspx?utm_medium=email&amp;amp;utm_source=govdelivery" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(6, 66, 118); text-decoration-line: none; text-size-adjust: 100%;" target="_blank"&gt;OregonHealthCare.gov/GetHelp&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to connect with an expert.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Start 2026 with peace of mind&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This season, remind friends and family to review their coverage and explore affordable private health insurance options at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://healthcare.oregon.gov/Pages/index.aspx?utm_medium=email&amp;amp;utm_source=govdelivery" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(6, 66, 118); text-decoration-line: none; text-size-adjust: 100%;" target="_blank"&gt;OregonHealthCare.gov&lt;/a&gt;. &ldquo;We&rsquo;re here to help you start 2026 covered&mdash;and start the year with peace of mind,&rdquo; said Flowers.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;###&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Oregon Health Insurance Marketplace, a part of state government, helps people get health insurance when they do not have job-based coverage, and do not qualify for a public program like Oregon Health Plan (OHP), OHP Bridge, or another program. The Marketplace is the state-level partner to HealthCare.gov. For more information, go to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://healthcare.oregon.gov/Pages/index.aspx?utm_medium=email&amp;amp;utm_source=govdelivery" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(6, 66, 118); text-decoration-line: none; text-size-adjust: 100%;" target="_blank"&gt;OregonHealthCare.gov&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;December 22, 2025 &mdash; Salem, Ore.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt; As Oregonians prepare for one of the busiest travel periods of the year, the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oregon Department of Emergency Management &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;(OEM) is urging residents and visitors to take extra precautions. A series of weather systems will bring rain, mountain snow, and increasingly strong winds through Wednesday, creating potentially hazardous travel conditions across the state and may bring additional power outages.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;According to the National Weather Service, waves of snow showers, gusty coastal winds, and a potential for strong inland winds may impact travel&mdash;particularly over mountain passes, on the coast and along the Iâ'5 corridor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weather Hazards to Expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:18pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;Mountain Snow and Pass Travel&lt;span style="font-size:14pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Snow showers will continue through Tuesday, with snow levels between &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2,500 and 4,000 feet&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Travelers crossing the Cascades should expect &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;slick roads, reduced visibility.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Winds&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Breezy to gusty winds return to the coast and Coast Range today, with a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;45&ndash;70% chance of gusts exceeding 45 mph&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;A stronger wind event is possible Wednesday, with a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25&ndash;50% chance of major wind impacts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;45&ndash;58 mph gusts inland&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul style="list-style-type:circle"&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;55&ndash;70 mph gusts along beaches and headlands&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;The Iâ'5 corridor may experience up to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;six hours of peak gusts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;, though exact timing remains uncertain.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;Coastal Thunderstorms&lt;span style="font-size:14pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;A &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10&ndash;25% chance of thunderstorms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt; exists along the coast today, bringing the potential for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;locally heavy rain, small hail, gusty winds, and occasional lightning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;River Conditions&lt;span style="font-size:14pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Minor flooding will persist along the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pudding River at Aurora&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt; through today, though levels are trending downward.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Latest river forecasts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW232977702 BCX8" href="https://water.noaa.gov/" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(70, 120, 134); font-size:12pt"&gt;https://water.noaa.gov/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safety Concerns Beyond the Weather&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:18pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fallen Trees and Power Outages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Recent heavy rainfall has left soils saturated across western Oregon. Combined with strong winds, this increases the likelihood of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;downed trees and power lines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;. Travelers should be prepared for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Sudden road blockages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Localized outages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Delays on major routes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size:12pt"&gt;Tree limbs can break without warning, especially in high winds or under the weight of snow and ice, so be extra cautious when walking outdoors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Read more about power outage safety &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW232977702 BCX8" href="https://apps.oregon.gov/oregon-newsroom/OR/OEM/Posts/Post/winter-power-outages" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size:12pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;Hazardous Water Conditions&lt;span style="font-size:14pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;OEM strongly advises the public to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;stay out of rivers, streams, and coastal waters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;. As runoff from last week&rsquo;s atmospheric river continues moving through the system:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Waterways contain &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;high levels of debris&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;, including branches and logs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;There is potential for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;sewage contamination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Fastâ'moving, cold water increases the risk of injury or drowning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Preparedness Guidance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:18pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;Check Conditions Before You Go&lt;span style="font-size:14pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Expect delays and allow extra travel time. Rushed drivers are unsafe drivers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fill up your gas tank. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Be prepared for taking longer detours or remaining idle for an extended periods of time due to traffic jams by having plenty of gas in your tank.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW232977702 BCX8" href="https://tripcheck.com/" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TripCheck.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt; or call &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;511&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt; for realâ'time road conditions, chain requirements, and incident updates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Make sure you &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;have Wireless Emergency Alerts activated on your phone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt; and are Signed up for emergency alerts for the area in Oregon you are visiting by going to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW232977702 BCX8" href="https://oralert.gov/" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(70, 120, 134); font-size:12pt"&gt;ORAlert.gov&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt; and typing in your destination&rsquo;s zip code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;If you are visiting another state, search for that state&rsquo;s Department of Emergency Management and look for their instructions on how to receive alerts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;If you end up stuck in snow, keep your car running as much as possible to stay warm, but &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;keep the area around your exhaust pipe clear&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;Give Snowplows Space&lt;span style="font-size:14pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Never pass a snowplow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Maintain a safe following distance&mdash;plows often create clouds of snow that reduce visibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Crews need room to operate safely; your patience helps keep everyone on the road safer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;For more safe winter driving tips visit the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW232977702 BCX8" href="https://www.oregon.gov/odot/pages/winter-driving.aspx" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(70, 120, 134); font-size:12pt"&gt;Oregon Department of Transportation&rsquo;s Winter Driving Safety webpage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;, or read this article on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW232977702 BCX8" href="https://apps.oregon.gov/oregon-newsroom/OR/OEM/Posts/Post/Get-Prepared-for-Winter-Driving" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(70, 120, 134); font-size:12pt"&gt;Getting Ready for Winter Driving&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;Pack an Emergency Car Kit&lt;span style="font-size:14pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW232977702 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OEM recommends every vehicle carry:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
